  "releaseNotes": "Breaking: flat generated members (IsLoading{Name}, {Name}Error, {Name}Command, Try{Name}Command) are replaced by one {Name}State property per member.\n- [Command] generates CommandState (Task/ValueTask/void) or CommandState<T> with Result/HasResult (Task<T>/ValueTask<T>/T).\n- [Event, Command] generates EventCommandState<TEvent>.\n- Latest-wins cancellation via an optional trailing CancellationToken parameter.\n- New [Reactive] fields generate a ReactiveState<T> twin (Value/SetSilently/Initial/IsDirty/Reset) with an optional partial On{Name}Changed(T value) hook.",
